{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778425528822,"sessionID":"ses_1ed941ac7ffeJZGr9NmcScNDUO","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-a3c20b668c1b3be6","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/tmp/slop-factory-work/momentum-flip-9a9f24d6/TASKS.md","offset":1,"limit":200},"output":"<path>/tmp/slop-factory-work/momentum-flip-9a9f24d6/TASKS.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: 1. HTML Scaffold — Create index.html with header, description, controls list, canvas, restart button, stub script tag, and matching meta.json file.\n2: 2. Game State Objects — Define player, hazards, score, and phase objects with initial values at top of script.\n3: 3. Animation Loop — Implement startLoop() using requestAnimationFrame, with cancelAnimationFrame handling, try/catch, and clear canvas.\n4: 4. Input Handling — Set up keys Set with keydown/keyup listeners, R-key restart, and restart button click invoking reset().\n5: 5. Player Movement — Add dt‑based physics for acceleration, velocity reversal on tap, speed caps, and bounds clamping.\n6: 6. Hazard System — Create hazard data structure, spawn logic with SAFE_RADIUS, and dt‑scaled motion.\n7: 7. Collision Detection — Detect player‑hazard collisions, switch phase to \"gameover\", and halt gameplay.\n8: 8. Scoring — Increment score on events, render score text at top‑left of canvas.\n9: 9. Rendering — Draw background, hazards, player (high contrast), and HUD each frame.\n10: 10. Game‑Over Overlay — Dim screen, show \"Game Over\", final score, and restart instructions.\n11: 11. Observable Contract — Expose window.__game each frame with state, score, player visibility, and objective description.\n12: 12. Audio System — Initialize AudioContext lazily, add beep() helper, and hook sounds to hit, score, and death events.\n\n(End of file - total 12 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"1. HTML Scaffold — Create index.html with header, description, controls list, canvas, restart button, stub script tag, and matching meta.json file.\n2. Game State Objects — Define player, hazards, score, and phase objects with initial values at top of script.\n3. Animation Loop — Implement startLoop() using requestAnimationFrame, with cancelAnimationFrame handling, try/catch, and clear canvas.\n4. Input Handling — Set up keys Set with keydown/keyup listeners, R-key restart, and restart button click invoking reset().\n5. Player Movement — Add dt‑based physics for acceleration, velocity reversal on tap, speed caps, and bounds clamping.\n6. Hazard System — Create hazard data structure, spawn logic with SAFE_RADIUS, and dt‑scaled motion.\n7. Collision Detection — Detect player‑hazard collisions, switch phase to \"gameover\", and halt gameplay.\n8. Scoring — Increment score on events, render score text at top‑left of canvas.\n9. Rendering — Draw background, hazards, player (high contrast), and HUD each frame.\n10. Game‑Over Overlay — Dim screen, show \"Game Over\", final score, and restart instructions.\n11. Observable Contract — Expose window.__game each frame with state, score, player visibility, and objective description.\n12. Audio System — Initialize AudioContext lazily, add beep() helper, and hook sounds to hit, score, and death events.","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"tmp/slop-factory-work/momentum-flip-9a9f24d6/TASKS.md","time":{"start":1778425528805,"end":1778425528821}},"id":"prt_e126bfd1a001QE90RrVIyfxQGN","sessionID":"ses_1ed941ac7ffeJZGr9NmcScNDUO","messageID":"msg_e126bf76d001e6Bxzj5C487WY2"}}
